# Crew and relationship beats, trait reactions, and inactive-friendly events.

# Private dilemma that surfaces later.
card dil_stash
type dilemma
days 3 30
weight 8
duration 3
roles A
when cond A ok
lean warm share keep
text {A} finds three unlogged ration packs taped behind a panel. Nobody else knows.
option keep | Keep them quiet | {A} moves them to a locker. For emergencies. Probably.
  set stash_kept
  mark t_stash
  who stash_who A
  morale A 6
option share | Hand them in | {A} hands them to the galley. Dinner is briefly excellent.
  set stash_shared
  res food 3
  morale A 2

card stash_found
type beat
due
once
days 12 41
roles A B
when flag stash_kept
when since t_stash >= 10
when is A stash_who
when same A B
text {B} finds the stash in {A}'s locker. {A} shares it out on the spot. Dessert all round.
do bond A B 6
do morale A 3
do set stash_exposed

card beat_watch
type beat
days 1 42
weight 10
cooldown 5
roles A B
when same A B
when bond A B >= -20
text {A} and {B} share the night watch. Mostly they talk about home.
do bond A B 6

card beat_argue
type beat
days 2 42
weight 8
cooldown 6
roles A B
when trait A warm <= -10
when same A B
text {A} and {B} spend a whole shift debating the thermostat. They settle on 21 degrees and a truce.
do bond A B -4

# Trait-driven reaction: what happens depends on how brave A is.
card glint
type event
days 4 38
weight 8
cooldown 9
roles A
when trait A curious >= 15
when cond A ok
lean brave closer window
text {A} spots a glint off the starboard quarter.
option closer | Go and look | {A} suits up without asking anyone and comes back with a bolt from a much older ship.
  var glints 1
  trait A brave 3
option window | Watch from the window | {A} logs it and watches from the window until it's gone.
  trait A curious 2

# Inactive-friendly: only fires for astronauts whose owner hasn't been in for a while,
# and makes them look good.
card quiet_fixer
type beat
days 3 42
weight 12
cooldown 4
roles A
when idle A >= 3
when cond A ok
text {A} quietly fixes the galley pump again. Nobody asked; nobody needed to.
do res spares 1
do morale A 3

card galley_pump
type event
days 1 42
weight 6
cooldown 8
roles A
when res spares >= 1
text The galley pump fails again. {A} fixes it and narrates the whole repair like a nature documentary.
do res spares -1
do morale A -2
